sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as Operator
    participant SDK as markov-sdk
    participant Pr as markov-program / engine
    participant A as Owner A (cap 100)
    participant B as Owner B (cap 100)
    participant C as Owner C (cap 40)
    participant Ix as indexer
    participant Fl as Float

    Op->>SDK: publish PolicyTemplate v0
    SDK->>SDK: hash template = strategy_id
    SDK->>Fl: strategy card listed
    A->>Pr: create_mandate from template (defaults)
    B->>Pr: create_mandate from template (defaults)
    C->>Pr: create_mandate from template, per-tx cap lowered to 40
    Note over A,C: funds stay in each owner's mandate account
    Op->>Pr: execute_swap size 60 across all subscribers
    Pr-->>Ix: ActionExecuted A ok (strategy_id)
    Pr-->>Ix: ActionExecuted B ok (strategy_id)
    Pr-->>Ix: ActionRefused C OverTxCap (strategy_id)
    Ix->>Fl: strategy_stats update - actions 2, refusals 1
    Fl-->>A: console feed + refusal flagged on card
    C->>Pr: revoke (or Telegram /revoke via emergency key)
    Op->>Pr: next attempt on C
    Pr-->>Ix: ActionRefused C Revoked
